<title>GERMANY: Rosenthal sees small profit for 1997.</title>
<headline>Rosenthal sees small profit for 1997.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germany's Rosenthal AG said on Monday it expected a small profit and zero growth in sales in the current year.</p>
</text>
